  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;be a chord of length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn></math> of the circle<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mrow><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>169</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math><br />If tangents drawn to the circle at points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> intersect at the point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math>, then five times the distance of point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> from chord <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math> is equal to _____.",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "72",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Plotting the diagram of given value we have,</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f2b1ff59-20b7-41b2-b9ae-8a5d83fd723a-image.png\" style=\"width: 240px; height: 175px;\" /></p><p>Now given, radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msqrt><mn>169</mn></msqrt><msqrt><mn>4</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Now by diagram&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi></math>&nbsp;is the midpoint of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></math>&nbsp;so,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p>Now in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>P</mi></math>,&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>cot</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></math></p><p>And in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi>O</mi><mi>A</mi><mi>M</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6</mn><mfrac><mn>13</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>cos</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>13</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfrac><mn>12</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>72</mn><mn>5</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>5</mn><mi>P</mi><mi>M</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
